<title>INDIA: ABN-AMRO Bank reduces India prime rate to 15.5 pct.</title>
<headline>ABN-AMRO Bank reduces India prime rate to 15.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN-AMRO Bank NV will reduce its Indian prime lending rate to 15.5 percent per annum from 16.0 percent, an official at its Bombay office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The new rate is exclusive of interest tax and will take effect from July 15, he said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
